<view class="page safe-page animate-in"><view class="eyebrow">RIGHT NOW</view><view class="title">告诉 TA 你的此刻</view><view class="subtitle">一句小小的状态，也是一种陪伴。</view><view class="sheet"><view class="label">选择状态</view><view class="presets"><view wx:for="{{presets}}" wx:key="code" class="preset {{preset===item.code?'active':''}}" data-code="{{item.code}}" bindtap="choose" aria-role="radio" aria-checked="{{preset===item.code}}"><text>{{item.icon}}</text>{{item.label}}</view></view><input wx:if="{{preset==='custom'}}" class="custom" value="{{customText}}" maxlength="-1" placeholder="例如：在图书馆认真学习" bindinput="inputCustom"/><view wx:if="{{preset==='custom'}}" class="count">{{customText.length}} / 20</view><view class="label spaced">保持多久</view><view class="durations"><view wx:for="{{durations}}" wx:key="minutes" class="duration {{duration===item.minutes?'active':''}}" data-minutes="{{item.minutes}}" bindtap="chooseDuration">{{item.label}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="submit" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">让 TA 看见</button></view>
